   <h4><a name="Financial_Institution" id="Financial_Institu"></a><strong>Unclaimed Property for Financial Institutions</strong></h4>
    <p>This free workshop covers subjects of interest to the  banking community such as:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Property types and issues unique to financial  institutions</li>
      <li>Aging and controlling inactive customer accounts</li>
      <li>Inactivity charges and ceasing interest</li>
